	"data": "Root Chakra Archaeology — Seven Years to Germination\n\nThe Journal\n\nOn October 19, 2019, Chris paced around his room for 47 minutes, 21,000 steps deep, and talked into a recorder. He was tired from camping. He had a video chat with the \"Notion guy\" coming up. He'd just gotten into a Unity VR escape room course. And he was in the final weeks of what he called his \"root chakra year\" — a year of building foundations.\n\nListening to this journal today is like watching someone plant seeds and then…",
